    "roles": ["band_member", "session", "touring", "composer", "percussionist"],
    "summary": "Slayer's co-founding drummer and the reference point for thrash and extreme metal drumming. Created a new double-bass vocabulary on Show No Mercy and Reign in Blood at what felt like inhuman tempos, in a sound he calls controlled chaos. Born in Havana and raised on his family's Latin records, he later recognised Cuban and Afro-Caribbean syncopation running through his metal parts. Since Slayer: Fantômas, Mr. Bungle, Dead Cross, Suicidal Tendencies, Misfits, Testament and solo percussion work."
  },
